  'ThreadpoolSearchRejected — >0이면 클라이언트가 에러를 받는 중 → 즉시 조사': { en: 'ThreadpoolSearchRejected — >0 means clients are receiving errors → investigate immediately', zh: 'ThreadpoolSearchRejected — >0 表示客户端正在收到错误 → 立即排查', ja: 'ThreadpoolSearchRejected — >0 ならクライアントがエラーを受信中 → 直ちに調査' },
